.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519

# =========================
# Agent operating files (core-context.md Context File Policy)
# core-context.md is NOT tracked here. The library's policy says to track it,
# but it carries personal and internal business context that does not belong
# in this repo. Read it from the Prompt & Agent Library instead.
# Root-anchored on purpose: the ETL subtree tracks folder-level AGENTS.md
# guardrails by design, and those stay. Only the repo-root operating files
# are ignored here.
# =========================
/CLASSHUMAN.md
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/core-context.md
.claude/
.remember/
ai-code-reviews/

# =========================
# CodeGuard instruction files
# Distributed onto this machine from the Prompt & Agent Library; they were
# never tracked in elder-futhark-academy either. Consume, don't fork — the
# canonical copy lives in the library.
# =========================
.github/instructions/

